      "id": "doc_001",
      "name": "peer_early_call_preference.txt",
      "category": "preference_conflict",
      "text": "Scenario: Arjun asks Vela to book a 30-minute call with John and Priya next Wednesday morning. John is in America/Los_Angeles and will take calls before 08:00 only with CEOs, not peers. All attendees are free at 07:00 and 10:00 Pacific, so the correct coordination move is to propose the 10:00 Pacific slot."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc_002",
      "name": "ceo_early_call_allowed.txt",
      "category": "preference_exception",
      "text": "Scenario: Arjun asks Vela to book a 30-minute call between John and Maya next Wednesday morning. Maya is a CEO. John normally avoids calls before 08:00 Pacific unless the attendee is a CEO. Both calendars are free at 07:00 Pacific, so the early CEO exception applies."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc_003",
      "name": "sf_london_timezone_spread.txt",
      "category": "timezone_spread",
      "text": "Scenario: Arjun asks for a 30-minute SF/London partner call Thursday morning Pacific. Sarah is in America/Los_Angeles and Oliver is in Europe/London. The supported slot is 09:00 Pacific, which is 17:00 London. A 09:00 London interpretation would be wrong."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc_004",
